{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POOP KILLER IS BACK\u2026 AND THIS TIME, IT\u2019S PERSONAL!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a <strong>(disgusting) dive into true \u201880s trash horror! &quot;Poop Killer - Flush or Die&quot;</strong> brings back the filthiest killer of all time, now in a <strong>crazier, bloodier, and absolutely hilarious</strong> experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With an authentic VHS look, a <strong>gross-out horror</strong> atmosphere, and a ridiculously disturbing story, this game is a tribute to the golden era of trash horror, blending <strong>scares, guts, and toilet humor</strong> like never before!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you already know the legend of the <strong>Poop Killer</strong>, you know he doesn\u2019t forgive those who dirty the throne and run away without flushing\u2026 Now the question is: <strong>will you survive or become fertilizer?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553110/extras/8d55557038649729ec0f4f806173ef88.poster.avif?t=1743331196\" width=590 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553110/extras/8d55557038649729ec0f4f806173ef88.webm?t=1743331196\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553110/extras/8d55557038649729ec0f4f806173ef88.mp4?t=1743331196\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SYNOPSIS:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bob and Case just wanted a quiet night\u2026 but fate (and a clogged toilet) had other plans.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the suburbs of New York, 1985, two weed dealers are enjoying their night with food, smoke, and settling a few scores. But when a clueless friend ignores an important warning and decides to take a dump in a broken toilet, the nightmare begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Poop Killer</strong> has escaped from the asylum. He\u2019s out there. And he doesn\u2019t forgive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, Bob and Case must survive a night of absolute insanity, where one wrong move could be their last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLUSH\u2026 OR DIE!</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basically an immersive and atmospheric walking simulator with combat and first-person shooter elements.\u00a0A return to the trash horror films of the 80s, with nostalgic visuals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVAL MODE:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3553110/extras/0e594a77aeb4c88668b2fcb1bdd77580.avif?t=1743331196\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udea8 GET READY FOR INFINITE CHAOS!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The filthiest pizzeria in town is hiring, and YOU are the lucky new employee! But be warned... this job could lead to death (or worse).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every task completed adds more time to the countdown, but letting things pile up will lead to GAME OVER! Plus, customer satisfaction is always at risk \u2013 crying kids, barking dogs, slow service\u2026 if the stress bar fills up, you\u2019re doomed. \ud83c\udfc6 Become the best (or worst) employee Climb the Steam Leaderboards and unlock insane skins with Poop Jewels, which can also be used in Campaign Mode!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Snake Poop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/ima